								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Okay, I&#039;ll bite.<br /><br />Why Did I say I didn&#039;t want anything? Well, 2 reasons really. First off - I really don&#039;t want anything, for christmas or my birthday. Would like to make a trip to see some old friends over a weekend sometime soon but for the birthday, but thats outa topic. Secondly - I volunteered to give up the money my parents spend on me to use on the siblings gifts, why? Because my family...isnt the richest this year. Because my dads a drunk-pot-smoker? Hell no. It&#039;s for another reason that&#039;s off topic as well. There, you have my answer, and if you flame me one more time on this topic. . .it won&#039;t be pretty.
						</td>
					</tr>
