							Congrats on missing the point of why I even flamed you.&nbsp; Who gives a shit if you don&#039;t want anything.&nbsp; It was the fact that you went with the oh so righteous &quot;christmas isn&#039;t about gifts&quot;, when your mom was trying to be nice.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">There, you have my answer, and if you flame me one more time on this topic. . .it won&#039;t be pretty.</div><br />hahaha, you stupid peice of shit.<br /><br />Mgram<br /><br />
