							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I am not in the Christmas spirit this year. We are dirt poor this year because all our money is going to bills and my 10 month old daughter.&nbsp; All I want for Christmas is to be debt free!! hmmmm anyone want my eq account its for another 6 mo its already paid for !! LMAO&nbsp; Name your price. I would take 250 or best offer 8P Hey if you want to offer more it will all go to my daughter for Birthday and Christmas!!&nbsp; The sad thing is I prolly wouldnt take the money because its been like 5 years of sweat, tears and time wasted! Oh well it was a thought. Flame me and make my Christmas even more horrid.&nbsp; I&nbsp; know you all want to so dont disappoint me&nbsp; 8P. Besides I know its coming.<br /><br />Colleen Quickness
