								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1310.msg12996#msg12996">Re: Seasons Bitchings</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> December 08, 2004, 11:04:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I remember one time I was grinding (duoing with a paladin) in FM, years ago, and this cool uber high level ranger I&#039;d never met came up and helped us by pulling and healing and just PLing us in general.  No, I could never flame Colleen.   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley6.gif" alt="smiley6" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
