							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Oh, the irony of posting on a flame-designated forum and then getting mad when you&#039;re flamed in return.</div><br />Doesn&#039;t that always happen here? ~.~<br /><br />Okay, Yes. So I was a little mad. And yes, I took it out on her when its really my oblviousness.<br />Okay, Yes. I&#039;m still an imature little prick, But I&#039;ve still got lots of growing time.<br />
